#[chapter/21/lore]{
  notes: [
    "Seen from Boof's height fourteen inches above Bonk City's cobblestones, guild boots, dropped berry crumbs, and drain-grate steam map the city more honestly than its speeches."
    "Torch-ants keep winter detour trails running around heavy porters' boots along warm mortar seams."
    "Under the feast committee's tall tables, tucked receipts and flour-dusted toes point straight toward the bakehouse and cellar chute."
  ]
}

